            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Dong Xuan",
            "review_text": "Keith\nNorth Walsham, United Kingdom21 contributions\n0\nAll round poor, expensive and targeted at the Chinese.\nJun 2023 • Couples\nVery average to poor quality food. Over priced. \nVery miserable and frankly rude staff particularly the cashier. \nNo napkins provided but some pre packed wet wipes on the table then they charge you VND2000 each for using. Agreed this is peanuts but it’s the principle. \n\nAir con barely working. \n\nI had almost finished my meal before my wife’s arrived. \n\nOnly imported beer. \n\nMy advice don’t use them. Many other places better to use. Give those who want to give service your patronage.\nRead more\nWritten June 13, 2023",
